Z||000000||1FST2M6||11-06-2000||09:48 AM||||Well after lowering my car Friday night, i took it to the alignment shop saturday mornin. they said we'll have it done shortly Mr. Hall...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> after about 30min of the car being on the rack the Alignment DORK comes in and says "sir is this a grey market car" i'm like uum WHAT? no its a Fiero.. it was made here.. "well sir we don't have ANY information on a 95 Pontiac Fiero" I couldn't help myself from laughing... so dude was all puzzled i told him its an 87 and i want -1* in all 4 corners... 2 hours later hes taking the car down and Lyndsay jokes about it scraping the alignment rack.. as Lyndsay makes another crak about the guy looking like the parking attendant from Ferris Beullers Day off as he leaves the parking lot pulling around the building.. well not a minute later i see my car SCREAMING by the shop well over 80mph!! Lynds' laughing her @$$ off and the shop managers face and bald head turns BRIGHT RED! i pay my $54.62 and get my print out... the aligment guyS pull in to a space and tosses me the keys and say "Nice car" mean while the car WREAKS of heated Brakes and the manager is standing at the front door waitn' for the alignment guys!! We left laughing.. that guy got a hell of a realming i'm sure!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">   I'll post pics of the camber later tonite. Never laughed so hard in my life!! a 95!! LMAO   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> thought i'd wet my pants... then to see it FLY by... oh.. my tummy hurt!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   pics to follow soon..<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mouse.gif">     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstsig1.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 11-06-2000).]||||reg||1
