Z||000007||1FST2M6||11-06-2000||11:34 AM||||I know the manager and sales guys there and i had them set the car to my specs not the Factory... NO CLUE where he got the 95 from?!? Probly cause it's SHINEY!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> and he's Apparently been stuck under to many civics to pay attention to anything else on the road. and  for $50 i got my car aligned and have life time free re-alignments (Goodyear offers that too) It's just a car, it's insured and if he smacked it they'd buy me another one. thats what i tell eveyone that drives my car "don't care what you do to it.. but you break it you buy it" thats how it is mostly around here you can drive just about anyones car but if you screw it up make sure you know the shops # to get it fixed. (most of the guys that have anything to do with the shop will let you pilot thier stuff) <p>[This message has been edited by 1FST2M6 (edited 11-06-2000).]||||reg||1
